   "start": 135.5,
   "end": 137.0,
   "en": "Peppa, I was just saying hello.",
   "i": 32,
   "zh": "佩奇，我只是打个招呼。"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.4,
   "end": 140.0,
   "en": "I'm not Peppa Pig, I'm Mummy Pig.",
   "i": 33,
   "zh": "我不是佩奇，我是猪妈妈。"
  },
  {
   "start": 141.375,
   "end": 144.0,
   "en": "Oh yes, of course. Hello Mummy Pig.",
   "i": 34,
   "zh": "哦，是的，当然。猪妈妈你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.001,
   "end": 145.001,
   "en": "Hello.",
   "i": 35,
   "zh": "你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.1,
   "end": 147.0,
   "en": "And this is Daddy Pig.",
   "i": 36,
   "zh": "这是猪爸爸。"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.65,
   "end": 150.0,
   "en": "George.",
   "i": 37,
   "zh": "乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.924,
   "end": 153.0,
   "en": "And hello to you too Daddy Pig.",
   "i": 38,
   "zh": "猪爸爸你也好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.0,
   "end": 159.0,
   "en": "Excuse me, I've got a lot of work to do.",
   "i": 39,
   "zh": "对不起，我还有很多工作要做。"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.1,
   "end": 161.1,
   "en": "Hello.",
   "i": 40,
   "zh": "你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.824,
   "end": 163.0,
   "en": "Yes.",
   "i": 41,
   "zh": "是的。"
  },
  {
   "start": 163.001,
   "end": 164.0,
   "en": "Do this, do that.",
   "i": 42,
   "zh": "这样做，那样做。"
  },
  {
   "start": 164.001,
   "end": 166.0,
   "en": "No, thank you.",
   "i": 43,
   "zh": "不，谢谢。"
  },
  {
   "start": 166.2,
   "end": 167.2,
   "en": "Goodbye.",
   "i": 44,
   "zh": "再见。"
  },
  {
   "start": 170.0,
   "end": 173.0,
   "en": "Peppa is enjoying pretending to be Mummy Pig.",
   "i": 45,
   "zh": "佩奇很享受扮演猪妈妈。"
  },
  {
   "start": 174.15,
   "end": 176.0,
   "en": "But George is getting a bit bored.",
   "i": 46,
   "zh": "但是乔治有点无聊了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 177.1,
   "end": 180.0,
   "en": "Sorry Daddy Pig, I'm nearly finished.",
   "i": 47,
   "zh": "对不起猪爸爸，我快说完了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 181.0,
   "end": 183.0,
   "en": "There, all done.",
   "i": 48,
   "zh": "好了，一切都完成了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 183.15,
   "end": 186.0,
   "en": "Come on Daddy Pig, it's time you did some work.",
